606-2015 standard, at least as far as the tooth gap forms are
concerned, although no guarantees of conformance are made.  It is
merely meant to serve as an example after all.], a toothed wheel
typically used along with a chain to transmit motion.  If you now
start the Debugger, you should see a window similar to the one shown
